Error [E0112]: undo function `undo_mutate` parameter 1 is incompatible with `mutate`: type `String` does not match `Int`
  --> tests/ui/ffi_undo_parameter_type_mismatch.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     #Undo(undo_mutate) fn mutate(left: Int, right: Int) => Int = "std::cmp::max";
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: rollback passes the foreign call's captured arguments to the inverse with the same Jet signature
 Fix: make parameter 1 of `undo_mutate` use the same type and access convention as `mutate`
